<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Purchaser Directory</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #18212f;
    --muted: #667085;
    --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    --line: rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.12);
    --shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.09);
    --blue: #375a9e;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Avenir Next", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.14), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f5ef 0%, #f2eee6 100%);
  }
  .page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 32px clamp(12px, 1.5vw, 28px) 56px;
  }
  .hero, .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.08);
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .hero + .panel { margin-top: 18px; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  h1, h2 {
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .hero p, .panel p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .hero-links, .summary-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .hero-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(220, 231, 255, 0.78);
    border: 1px solid rgba(55, 90, 158, 0.18);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .summary-grid { margin-top: 20px; }
  .summary-card {
    flex: 1 1 180px;
    min-width: 180px;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(248, 247, 243, 0.88);
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.06);
  }
  .summary-card .label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .summary-card .value {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.08);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 12px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.08);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: rgba(243, 239, 230, 0.95);
  }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td {
    background: rgba(248, 247, 243, 0.7);
  }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .empty-state {
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(248, 247, 243, 0.85);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(24, 33, 47, 0.16);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Purchaser Directory</p>
    <h1>Browse every tracked purchaser.</h1>
    <p>Jump into a dedicated history page for any purchaser, including category mix and the underlying receipts.</p>
    <div class="hero-links">
      <a href="{{ data.main_report_html_href }}">Back to main report</a>
    </div>
    <div class="summary-grid">
      <article class="summary-card">
        <span class="label">Purchasers</span>
        <span class="value">{{ data.purchaser_count }}</span>
        <span class="subtext">Tracked purchaser buckets</span>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-card">
        <span class="label">Receipts</span>
        <span class="value">{{ data.total_receipts }}</span>
        <span class="subtext">Across the full database</span>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-card">
        <span class="label">Total Spend</span>
        <span class="value">{{ data.total_spend_display }}</span>
        <span class="subtext">All purchaser buckets combined</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Directory</h2>
    <p>Open a dedicated page with category mix and receipt-level detail for any purchaser.</p>
    {% if data.purchasers %}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Purchaser</th><th>Receipts</th><th>Total Spend</th><th>Share</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for row in data.purchasers %}
        <tr>
          <td><a href="{{ row.detail_html_href }}">{{ row.purchaser_label }}</a></td>
          <td>{{ row.count }}</td>
          <td>{{ row.total_spend_display }}</td>
          <td>{{ row.share_display }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">No purchaser data yet.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
